  "description": "One winter evening brings Se-Won and college senior Woo-Hyun together — and a night of passion leaves the omega with a secret child. Six years later, Woo-Hyun returns, unaware of the truth. As old feelings resurface, Se-Won must protect his son... even if it means pushing away the alpha he never forgot.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
